# Activity 03 – Buzzer

## Objective

To understand how to control a buzzer using an Arduino UNO.

## Components Used

- Arduino UNO
- Piezo Buzzer
- Breadboard
- Jumper Wires

## Circuit Diagram

![Circuit Diagram](circuit.png)

## Arduino Program

The Arduino program is available in the `code.ino` file.

## Output

The buzzer turns ON for one second and turns OFF for one second continuously.

